{"nodes": [{"id": "memory_initial_memory_04_key_decisions_and_findings_stack_discrepancy", "label": "Open Stack Discrepancy \u2014 Baseline vs Current Stack", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Baseline 02 records Express/Prisma/Redis/MinIO; CLAUDE.md and .claude/stack-decision.md have since moved to Next.js route handlers under /api/v1, Railway, Cloudflare R2, Postgres job queue and Clerk. Deliberately not auto-corrected \u2014 reconcile with the team first; Addendum A is the current source of truth.", "source_file": "Memory/Initial Memory/04-key-decisions-and-findings.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "memory_initial_memory_04_key_decisions_and_findings_positioning_tension", "label": "Positioning Tension \u2014 BTG Media vs Athlete Network", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The founder doc leads with BTG-owned media/audience; the v2.0 blueprint pivots to a micro-NIL athlete network; mockups still foreground BTG inventory. The data model is kept generic so launch emphasis is a merchandising/configuration choice, not a schema change.", "source_file": "Memory/Initial Memory/04-key-decisions-and-findings.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "memory_initial_memory_04_key_decisions_and_findings_qr_pii_surface", "label": "QR Reward PII Surface", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Every claim collects fan name/email/phone/ZIP \u2014 the most legally sensitive flow; needs consent-gated capture, purpose limitation, sponsors receiving only permitted fields, audited.", "source_file": "Memory/Initial Memory/04-key-decisions-and-findings.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "memory_initial_memory_04_key_decisions_and_findings_operating_loop_is_the_product", "label": "The Operating Loop Is the Product", "file_type": "rationale", "ra